1
00:00:00,450 --> 00:00:03,809
A contract-review interface is just the beginning.

2
00:00:04,700 --> 00:00:06,974
Company policies change.

3
00:00:07,016 --> 00:00:10,544
Teams need a different interface and fewer missed risks.

4
00:00:10,586 --> 00:00:12,937
Can your legal agent keep up?

5
00:00:13,867 --> 00:00:20,868
With PenguinHarness, describe what you need in one request to build a legal agent application with its own interface.

6
00:00:21,783 --> 00:00:29,121
Upload a contract, let the agent review it, then receive risks and suggested revisions in a working business process.

7
00:00:30,033 --> 00:00:35,893
Save your company’s review preferences in long-term memory, so you do not have to explain them again.

8
00:00:36,783 --> 00:00:44,313
In a fresh session, the agent applies those preferences to payment terms, data reuse and one-sided liability caps.

9
00:00:45,200 --> 00:00:51,817
Adapt the interface to your team, adding branded dashboards, status cards and an inline report preview.

10
00:00:52,700 --> 00:00:59,833
Changes hot reload into the application while existing reviews remain, helping the workflow keep pace with new requirements.

11
00:01:00,742 --> 00:01:03,953
The interface updates as processing progresses.

12
00:01:03,995 --> 00:01:07,957
When a review finishes, its report is ready to inspect.

13
00:01:08,908 --> 00:01:16,234
Turn missed risks into evaluation tasks, then use the same self-evolution loop to test and improve the review method.

14
00:01:17,117 --> 00:01:24,815
In our decision demo, this loop raised the average score from eighty-four to one hundred, for about fifteen cents in model calls.

15
00:01:25,700 --> 00:01:33,122
Here, five sample contract reviews cost about four cents in model calls: less than one cent each, on average.

16
00:01:33,992 --> 00:01:41,582
Bring creation, memory, interface updates and low-cost evolution together, so your application grows with your business.

17
00:01:42,450 --> 00:01:44,135
PenguinHarness.

18
00:01:44,177 --> 00:01:48,342
Building the most comprehensive platform for agent self-evolution.

19
00:01:48,384 --> 00:01:52,033
Download the app and explore the open-source repository.
